=== Text #18 ===
> WALDWICK, N.J. -- Thomas J. McLaughlin, of[ Wald]wick, died Thursday, Nov. 17. He was 86.
Born in the Bronx, in 1930,[ he] was[ a] longtime resident[ of Wald]wick.[ He was a construction supervisor at] AJ[ Contracting] in[ Manhattan, before] retiring.[ He] served in the U.S. Army during peacetime.
[He] is[ survived by his wife,] Theresa F. McL[aughlin;] children[, Thomas] J. McL[aughlin] Jr.[ and his] wife Jayne,[ Theresa] Karole, Michael McL[aughlin], Maureen McGinle and her husband Lawrence[ and] Ellen M. McLaughlin[;] grandchildren, Katherine, Devin,[ Thomas], John, Michael and Ashley[; and] sister[, Mary] Kate Jensen.
Visitation[ will] from 2-[5] p[.]m. Sunday at the[ Vander Pl]a[at] Funeral Home,[ 257] Godwin Ave[.,] Wyckoff. A funeral Mass will be celebrated at 11 a.m. Monday at Church of the Nativity, 315 Prospect St., Midland Park. Interment will follow at Ascension Cemetery in Monsey, N.Y.

